  "body": "Titles have now been issued.\r\n\r\nDesigned for families wanting quality, flexibility and an exceptional coastal location, Homes 2–4 at 198 Bucklands Beach Road offer thoughtfully planned layouts, premium finishes and the significant advantage of being positioned within the highly sought-after Macleans College zone.\r\n\r\nFor families prioritising schooling, this is a particularly strong opportunity: premium new homes in Bucklands Beach, close to the coast and within one of East Auckland’s most desirable school zones.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach, these homes bring together beachside living, excellent schooling and practical family design in a tightly held neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nAcross approximately 135–139sqm, the collection offers a choice of three and four-bedroom layouts, each designed to maximise natural light, everyday functionality and connection to the outdoors.\r\n\r\nOn the lower level, 2.7m stud heights create a sense of openness and scale, while designer kitchens connect naturally with dining and living spaces. Generous hardwood decking extends the homes outdoors, creating an easy setting for family BBQs, entertaining or relaxed evenings at home.\r\n\r\nHomes 2 and 3 offer three bedrooms plus an additional upstairs lounge, giving families a valuable second living space that works equally well as a children’s retreat, media room, study zone or quiet lounge.\r\n\r\nHome 4 steps up to a larger four-bedroom layout, with generous living, integrated kitchen and dining, and excellent family accommodation upstairs.\r\n\r\nEach home includes a spacious master suite with walk-in wardrobe and fully tiled ensuite, complemented by well-proportioned additional bedrooms and a beautifully finished family bathroom. Single internal-access garaging, thoughtful storage and practical laundry facilities complete the layouts.\r\n\r\nFinished in a premium combination of Nu-Wall aluminium cladding, weatherboard and brick, these homes are designed to offer enduring quality with a refined, low-maintenance coastal aesthetic.\r\n\r\nKey features\r\n\r\n- Titles issued\r\n- Located in the highly sought-after Macleans College zone\r\n- Approximately 135–145sqm floor areas\r\n- Choice of three and four-bedroom layouts\r\n- 2.5 bathrooms\r\n- Master suites with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n- Homes 2 & 3 feature an additional upstairs lounge\r\n- Premium designer kitchens\r\n- Open-plan kitchen and dining\r\n- 2.7m stud heights on the lower level\r\n- Generous hardwood decking\r\n- Fully tiled bathrooms with rainhead showers\r\n- Single internal-access garages\r\n- Practical laundry facilities\r\n- Premium Nu-Wall aluminium, weatherboard and brick exterior\r\n- Moments from Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach\r\n- Stamford 10-year Building Warranty\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact the Urban Haus team.\r\n\r\nFor new releases, project updates and behind-the-scenes content, follow @urbanhausnz on Instagram and Facebook.",
